Why These Use Cases? The use cases cover diverse prediction tasks, including classification and regression of throughput and energy consumption. They also span different temporal scales and spatial granularities: RANPerf models the long-term impact of configuration changes, EngSav captures short-term throughput variations under cell-sleeping policies, and EngCon predicts energy consumption at the coarser eNodeB level. RANPerf on 5G NR further tests transfer to a RAN technology whose configuration features are absent from pretraining. All tasks are adapted from the same pretrained backbone through task-specific fine-tuning, highlighting the flexibility of RAN-MP across RAN management applications.
